[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5858090250","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111137#issuecomment-5858090250","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111137","id":5858090250,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXStdCg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T17:26:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T18:02:37Z","body":"As @Ivorforce pointed out the hashset based out-of-tree path was wasteful as well. This PR now also includes a rewrite of that, which calculates the depth by iterating up the tree if the node is not in the tree.\r\n\r\nEven in a worst case scenario with two very deep and parallel branches, which leads to iterating up the tree 3 times this seems to be a solid 2x improvement over the hash set:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"501\" height=\"395\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c340c75-a67e-401b-92bc-4e842b998e5b\" />\r\n\r\n(Benchmark adjusted to be out-of-tree)\r\n\r\nI also added a bunch of test cases to ensure the behavior is consistent with the previous implementation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5858090250/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5859453625","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111137#issuecomment-5859453625","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111137","id":5859453625,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXUAquQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T20:15:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T07:58:54Z","body":"Yeah noticed that as well, but the context is very different. It is not exposed and has one usage which I'm not sure of what it does yet.\r\n\r\n~Btw it might be possible to apply the same hashmap replacement to `is_ancestor_of`